            "id": "ai-lore-b4afb866ba",
            "name": "Vespa's Origin and Motives",
            "type": "character",
            "visibility": "possible_canon",
            "description": "Vespa was an orphaned child abducted by Security Services to become one of the yellow heroes. Mistreated and gaining no power from their training, he awakened using a yellow stone he acquired before being taken, and now seeks to achieve his most powerful form while opposing the SS and councils.",
