          {
            "message_id": 1538150664520339456,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "Surname: Sethren \nName: Falko\nPossible nickname??: Hollowcoat\nAge:20 \nSex: Male \nHeight: 6’0” \nWeight: 178 lbs \nDescription:\nMuscular yet wiry build, his frame leaner than most fighters of similar stature, broad shouldered yet with less bulk evident in his arms. Overall, sturdy and healthy, but with more endurance than strength.\nMost distinguishing features:\nLong dark brown layered hair which is parted unevenly and falls messily around his face, with a thick rat tail falling from the back of his head down around his neck. Bangs hang unevenly from the front in thick clumps and strands, with others constantly falling around his ears and shoulders. His face is lean and angular, with a strong jaw and a pronounced, straight nose. His cheek bones are visible, giving him a hollow look to his cheeks, and his eyebrows are thick and uneven. His eyes are narrow and set deeply, and shadowed with heavy upper lids, giving him a perpetually tired and unapproachable look. Heavy stubble covers his jaw line, and a messier goatee hangs from his chin, with only a few days’ worth of growth on his upper lip. His eyes are a muted brown color, and often seem aloof and detached, more often than not tired, dull and irritable. Other distinguishing features are the dented shoulder bit he wears, the torn cloak slung over his right shoulder, the constant cigarette dangling from his lips, the small inconspicuous earring at the top of his left ear, the abraded knuckles from his workman’s gloves, the unkempt and stubbly jaw and the constant loose strands of hair falling around his face.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1538150664520339456",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T11:41:35.879000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538150664520339456,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "Surname: Sethren \nName: Falko\nPossible nickname??: Hollowcoat\nAge:20 \nSex: Male \nHeight: 6’0” \nWeight: 178 lbs \nDescription:\nMuscular yet wiry build, his frame leaner than most fighters of similar stature, broad shouldered yet with less bulk evident in his arms. Overall, sturdy and healthy, but with more endurance than strength.\nMost distinguishing features:\nLong dark brown layered hair which is parted unevenly and falls messily around his face, with a thick rat tail falling from the back of his head down around his neck. Bangs hang unevenly from the front in thick clumps and strands, with others constantly falling around his ears and shoulders. His face is lean and angular, with a strong jaw and a pronounced, straight nose. His cheek bones are visible, giving him a hollow look to his cheeks, and his eyebrows are thick and uneven. His eyes are narrow and set deeply, and shadowed with heavy upper lids, giving him a perpetually tired and unapproachable look. Heavy stubble covers his jaw line, and a messier goatee hangs from his chin, with only a few days’ worth of growth on his upper lip. His eyes are a muted brown color, and often seem aloof and detached, more often than not tired, dull and irritable. Other distinguishing features are the dented shoulder bit he wears, the torn cloak slung over his right shoulder, the constant cigarette dangling from his lips, the small inconspicuous earring at the top of his left ear, the abraded knuckles from his workman’s gloves, the unkempt and stubbly jaw and the constant loose strands of hair falling around his face.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1538150664520339456",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T11:41:35.879000+00:00",
            "lore_server": true
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538150668295217152,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "Wears:\nA torn and frayed dark cloak, which is worn with a fur hood slung over his head and around his shoulders. Underneath a long heavy fur coat, with a large fur hood that usually hangs around his neck and over his shoulders. He wears fingerless gloves, worn leather boots, with his trousers tucked into them, a slim belt holding a few pouches with useful items at his waist. His clothes are all dark, in muted colors of grey and brown, with touches of silver, and are worn and patched in several places, showing age and use.\nOverall impression:\nHe looks like someone who has spent a lifetime surviving in the wilderness and not a single day wasted on frivolous pursuits. All of his clothes are worn but serve a purpose, and everything about him speaks of a man used to working with his hands and living outdoors. He has a rugged appeal, but nothing overly heroic about him, with the unkempt dark hair, the tired eyes, the worn leather clothing and the generally unkempt appearance. He looks like a survivor, not a noble champion of any cause. He carries himself casually, leaning against things frequently and with one hand constantly in his coat pocket, giving him an easygoing but also indifferent appearance, until he has to do something that requires purposeful movement, in which case he moves with a certain economy of motion and appears more serious and focused.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1538150668295217152",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T11:41:36.779000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538150668295217152,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "Wears:\nA torn and frayed dark cloak, which is worn with a fur hood slung over his head and around his shoulders. Underneath a long heavy fur coat, with a large fur hood that usually hangs around his neck and over his shoulders. He wears fingerless gloves, worn leather boots, with his trousers tucked into them, a slim belt holding a few pouches with useful items at his waist. His clothes are all dark, in muted colors of grey and brown, with touches of silver, and are worn and patched in several places, showing age and use.\nOverall impression:\nHe looks like someone who has spent a lifetime surviving in the wilderness and not a single day wasted on frivolous pursuits. All of his clothes are worn but serve a purpose, and everything about him speaks of a man used to working with his hands and living outdoors. He has a rugged appeal, but nothing overly heroic about him, with the unkempt dark hair, the tired eyes, the worn leather clothing and the generally unkempt appearance. He looks like a survivor, not a noble champion of any cause. He carries himself casually, leaning against things frequently and with one hand constantly in his coat pocket, giving him an easygoing but also indifferent appearance, until he has to do something that requires purposeful movement, in which case he moves with a certain economy of motion and appears more serious and focused.",
            "attachments": [],
