          {
            "message_id": 1540672920760877129,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "A heavily reinforced robotic prosthetic extending from my shoulder, built for heavy weapons and extreme combat. It features a retractable grappling hook that can pull me toward enemies or drag enemies toward me, with Grapple Slingshot allowing me to launch myself toward targets at extreme speed. A Morphing Blade Socket compresses five long curved claws into a single needle-sharp ballistic spike; upon impact, the spike unfolds into five curved blades that anchor into targets and form a functional mechanical hand, with four blades as fingers and one as an opposing thumb. The arm has Weapon Lock for securing oversized weapons, Siege Mode with forearm braces and a shoulder lock, Impact Storage to absorb and release force, Momentum Bank to store momentum from heavy attacks and add it to the next strike, Recoil Conversion to turn weapon recoil into additional movement or force, retractable Anchor Claws, Force-Assisted Swing to accelerate heavy weapons, and a Gyroscopic Stabilizer to control vibration and momentum. It also features an Emergency Clamp that lets the forearm lock around a weapon if grip is lost, a lockable rotating wrist, layered armor, exposed pistons, reinforced joints, powerful mechanical grip, modular weapon mounts, and an intimidating advanced mechanical design.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1540672920760877129",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T10:44:08.628000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540672920760877129,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "A heavily reinforced robotic prosthetic extending from my shoulder, built for heavy weapons and extreme combat. It features a retractable grappling hook that can pull me toward enemies or drag enemies toward me, with Grapple Slingshot allowing me to launch myself toward targets at extreme speed. A Morphing Blade Socket compresses five long curved claws into a single needle-sharp ballistic spike; upon impact, the spike unfolds into five curved blades that anchor into targets and form a functional mechanical hand, with four blades as fingers and one as an opposing thumb. The arm has Weapon Lock for securing oversized weapons, Siege Mode with forearm braces and a shoulder lock, Impact Storage to absorb and release force, Momentum Bank to store momentum from heavy attacks and add it to the next strike, Recoil Conversion to turn weapon recoil into additional movement or force, retractable Anchor Claws, Force-Assisted Swing to accelerate heavy weapons, and a Gyroscopic Stabilizer to control vibration and momentum. It also features an Emergency Clamp that lets the forearm lock around a weapon if grip is lost, a lockable rotating wrist, layered armor, exposed pistons, reinforced joints, powerful mechanical grip, modular weapon mounts, and an intimidating advanced mechanical design.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1540672920760877129",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T10:44:08.628000+00:00",
            "lore_server": true
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540672924632219648,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "design: A massive, heavily reinforced robotic prosthetic extending directly from the shoulder, built like a brutal heavy-weapons platform. Dark layered armor plates cover exposed pistons, hydraulic mechanisms, reinforced joints, and rotating mechanical components. The forearm houses a concealed grappling launcher and retractable anchor claws, while the hand consists of powerful articulated metal fingers capable of locking around oversized weapons.\n\nThe wrist is thick and rotational, able to completely lock in place, while the forearm can unfold into reinforced Siege Mode braces that clamp around a weapon and connect its weight directly into the shoulder. The prosthetic contains a Morphing Blade Socket, where five long curved claws compress into a single needle-like ballistic spike before unfolding into a five-bladed mechanical hand upon impact.\n\nHeavy cables, modular weapon mounts, locking mechanisms, and compact gyroscopic systems are integrated throughout the arm. Its construction is rugged and intimidating, with scratched metal, exposed machinery, reinforced plating, and a powerful industrial silhouette designed to withstand enormous recoil, momentum, and the weight of weapons far beyond normal human limits.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1540672924632219648",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T10:44:09.551000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540672924632219648,
            "channel_id": 1535267861113602058,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1388446131620548760,
            "author_name": "Kaizen",
            "content": "design: A massive, heavily reinforced robotic prosthetic extending directly from the shoulder, built like a brutal heavy-weapons platform. Dark layered armor plates cover exposed pistons, hydraulic mechanisms, reinforced joints, and rotating mechanical components. The forearm houses a concealed grappling launcher and retractable anchor claws, while the hand consists of powerful articulated metal fingers capable of locking around oversized weapons.\n\nThe wrist is thick and rotational, able to completely lock in place, while the forearm can unfold into reinforced Siege Mode braces that clamp around a weapon and connect its weight directly into the shoulder. The prosthetic contains a Morphing Blade Socket, where five long curved claws compress into a single needle-like ballistic spike before unfolding into a five-bladed mechanical hand upon impact.\n\nHeavy cables, modular weapon mounts, locking mechanisms, and compact gyroscopic systems are integrated throughout the arm. Its construction is rugged and intimidating, with scratched metal, exposed machinery, reinforced plating, and a powerful industrial silhouette designed to withstand enormous recoil, momentum, and the weight of weapons far beyond normal human limits.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535267861113602058/1540672924632219648",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T10:44:09.551000+00:00",
            "lore_server": true
