          {
            "message_id": 1535710278010933269,
            "channel_id": 1535280141192929310,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 977420155120410624,
            "author_name": "Lord_Tanishk",
            "content": "Name: Kael Veyran\nAge: 23\nGender: Male\nHeight: 6'2\"\nWeight: 201 lbs\nClothing: A fitted dark undershirt, a weathered leather travel coat, practical trousers, sturdy worn boots, leather gloves, and a simple belt carrying several practical pouches. A small pendant hangs around his neck.\nClothing Color: Black and charcoal with dark brown and muted silver accents.\nHair: Medium-long white hair tied back neatly into a low ponytail, keeping most of it away from his face, with a few shorter strands framing his forehead.\nHair Color: White/silver.\n\nUnique Features: Different-colored irises + an eyepatch with a shallow scar beneath it.\n\nHis left eye is covered by a black leather eyepatch, while his visible right eye is a vivid emerald green. His covered left eye is naturally an unusual deep indigo-violet, with a faint luminous ring around the iris that becomes more noticeable in darkness or when he is experiencing strong emotions. The effect is subtle enough that it doesn't immediately appear magical. A thin, shallow scar runs beneath the eyepatch and extends slightly toward his eyebrow. The injury was never severe enough to impair his vision, and he can still see normally from both eyes; he simply continues wearing the eyepatch out of habit and personal style.\n\nKael has a tall, athletic build with a good amount of practical muscle without appearing excessively bulky. His appearance is naturally attractive, with a relaxed confidence that makes him look more like a troublesome wandering adventurer than a hardened soldier. He has the look of someone who has been in plenty of fights and knows how to handle himself, but he rarely feels the need to prove it.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535280141192929310/1535710278010933269",
            "created_at": "2026-08-08T18:04:22.395000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535710278010933269,
            "channel_id": 1535280141192929310,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 977420155120410624,
            "author_name": "Lord_Tanishk",
            "content": "Name: Kael Veyran\nAge: 23\nGender: Male\nHeight: 6'2\"\nWeight: 201 lbs\nClothing: A fitted dark undershirt, a weathered leather travel coat, practical trousers, sturdy worn boots, leather gloves, and a simple belt carrying several practical pouches. A small pendant hangs around his neck.\nClothing Color: Black and charcoal with dark brown and muted silver accents.\nHair: Medium-long white hair tied back neatly into a low ponytail, keeping most of it away from his face, with a few shorter strands framing his forehead.\nHair Color: White/silver.\n\nUnique Features: Different-colored irises + an eyepatch with a shallow scar beneath it.\n\nHis left eye is covered by a black leather eyepatch, while his visible right eye is a vivid emerald green. His covered left eye is naturally an unusual deep indigo-violet, with a faint luminous ring around the iris that becomes more noticeable in darkness or when he is experiencing strong emotions. The effect is subtle enough that it doesn't immediately appear magical. A thin, shallow scar runs beneath the eyepatch and extends slightly toward his eyebrow. The injury was never severe enough to impair his vision, and he can still see normally from both eyes; he simply continues wearing the eyepatch out of habit and personal style.\n\nKael has a tall, athletic build with a good amount of practical muscle without appearing excessively bulky. His appearance is naturally attractive, with a relaxed confidence that makes him look more like a troublesome wandering adventurer than a hardened soldier. He has the look of someone who has been in plenty of fights and knows how to handle himself, but he rarely feels the need to prove it.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535280141192929310/1535710278010933269",
            "created_at": "2026-08-08T18:04:22.395000+00:00",
            "lore_server": true
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535710371204042823,
            "channel_id": 1535280141192929310,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 977420155120410624,
            "author_name": "Lord_Tanishk",
            "content": "His personality is chaotic and playful, often using humor and teasing to keep people guessing. Beneath that carefree attitude, however, he is observant and private, rarely revealing what he is actually thinking or much about his past. His morality is somewhat flexible; he isn't needlessly cruel, but he has little problem bending rules when he believes there's a good enough reason. Overall, he comes across as a charismatic solo traveler who enjoys wandering from place to place and getting himself into situations that are probably more trouble than they're worth.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535280141192929310/1535710371204042823",
            "created_at": "2026-08-08T18:04:44.614000+00:00"
          },
