          {
            "message_id": 1540577661934501978,
            "channel_id": 1535434978781823097,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 980164651256000572,
            "author_name": "MintyWasDiscovered",
            "content": "**CIVILIAN’S SWORN-TO-BE EMPEROR: Mintevious**\n\nThen Sovereign of the Civilian’s republic, now wrongfully dethroned and exiled by an unknown influence. And at this moment he has just barely made his trek across vile terrain, exhausted and injured,  and is now standing at the gates of \"Regnum of Regalia\" in search for a new ark. Minty is a combination of what the world needed when times required moral people governed by moral decisions. Despite the collapse of his status, Minty still possesses optimistic traits, and still holds confidence for a hopeless yet possible refreshed journey ahead of him. However, it is appropriately called for that everybody has limits. no person can be perfect, nor would they be able to uphold their natural traits 100% of the time without flawed moments. That still wouldn't stop Minty from being the person he is, and neither does he give up striving closer to being impossibly perfect even if that means mistakes and flaws are bound to happen. \n\nMinty has a small men’s crown. He wears torn-up business attire under a gold-gilded velvet hooded cloak. Has a largely visible leather emblem of a rooster (hence, the emblem of the Civillian’s republic) to represent who still should've been the faithful ruler of his constituents. He holsters a dagger on his left, a flintlock pistol on his right, and carries a now powerless 5 ft scepter that still holds potential to somehow be re-ignited into a magical main weapon it once used to be. He either carries it behind his back or holds it in one hand, both can be when running or idle. He tends a long mustache. He gives off a somewhat nervous/paranoia energy to his expressions and emotions.\n\nAge: 25\nSex: male\nHeight: 5’8. Not small but isnt that tall either.\nWeight: 160 LB\nNickname: Minty\nhair: black and messy",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535434978781823097/1540577661934501978",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T04:25:37.154000+00:00"
          },
