            "content": "Name: Dargan\nAge: 19\nGender: Male\nHeight: 6'2\" (188 cm)\nWeight: 94 kg (207 lbs)\nBuild: Muscular, broad shoulders, thick arms, athletic physique\nPersonality: Quiet, innocent, respectful, and naturally kind. Despite his intimidating appearance, Dargan is soft-hearted and often assumes the best in people. He doesn't look for fights, but he won't back down when someone threatens the people he cares about.\n\nClothing: A fitted black sleeveless shirt under a dark oversized jacket, loose tactical-style pants, and heavy black boots. He wears simple wrist wraps and a plain silver chain around his neck.\n\nClothing Colors: Black, charcoal gray, and dark brown with small silver details.\n\nHair: Long, thick dreadlocks that fall around his shoulders and down his back. His dreads are slightly messy and give him a rugged appearance.\n\nHair Color: Dark brown, almost black.\n\nFace: Strong jawline, thick eyebrows, sharp cheekbones, and a calm expression. His muscular build and serious-looking face make him appear intimidating even when he's completely relaxed.\n\nUnique Features\n\n1. Scarred knuckles: His knuckles have several small, faded scars, giving his hands a rough, experienced appearance.\n\n2. Small scar across the eyebrow: A thin scar cuts through his left eyebrow, adding to his tough appearance without making him look overly battle-worn.\n\nOverall Appearance\n\nDargan looks like someone who could easily intimidate an entire room without saying a word. He's tall, heavily built, and muscular, with dark brown dreads and a sharp jawline. However, his personality contrasts strongly with his appearance. Dargan is genuinely innocent and kind-hearted, which often surprises people when they actually get to know him.",
