            "content": "Surname: Valentine\n Name: Violet\n Possible nickname??: Lady V, The Crimson Dame\n Age: 26\n Sex: Female\n Height: 5'8\" (173 cm)\n Weight: 178 lbs (81 kg)\n Description: A curvy, thick-built woman with wide hips, full thighs, a narrow waist, and a prominent bust. She has pale warm-toned skin, long dark brown hair, sharp green eyes, and a confident, mischievous expression. Her theatrical beauty and flirtatious smile give her an almost dangerous charm. Despite her voluptuous figure, she moves with surprising grace and carries herself with an elegant, commanding presence.\n Wears: A deep crimson top hat with a black band and playing-card decoration, a matching burgundy choker, a crimson-and-black corset-style outfit, dark thigh-high stockings, black heels, red wrist cuffs, and decorative playing-card accessories, its not nudity.",
