          {
            "message_id": 1540706027962499163,
            "channel_id": 1540704112239190087,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1192722608622411816,
            "author_name": "m8g3",
            "content": "Name: Balthazar\nAge: 28\nSex: Male\nHeight: 6'4\" (193 cm)\nWeight: 225 lbs (102 kg)\nDescription: A tall, imposing man with a heavily muscular, athletic build and broad shoulders. He has pale skin, sharp masculine features, a strong jawline, and intense crimson-red eyes that give him an intimidating, almost supernatural presence. His thick, unruly black hair falls around his face in wild curls, adding to his predatory appearance. Despite his enormous physique, he carries himself with calm confidence and an almost regal stillness.\nWears: A long, flowing black-and-midnight-blue cloak draped over his shoulders, leaving his muscular chest and abdomen exposed. He wears fitted black armored gloves and sleek black trousers with reinforced, polished black boots. The outfit is minimalistic but imposing, giving him the appearance of a dark warrior or fallen noble.",
