            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Mariam caught the horn, screaming hail blast before blowing it her aro connection being to wither away with each blow but Prana was able to catch Vespa with a Hail blast as he charged throwing him 2.8 billion light years away, but in just a millsecond he came back and appeared before prana charging up once again**",
