          {
            "message_id": 1535433741093179534,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1311460994660306996,
            "author_name": "Draven",
            "content": "# @everyone visit <#1535189087760154667> to know power system yes. Me and civic came up with it",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535433741093179534",
            "created_at": "2026-08-07T23:45:30.856000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535844738890989569,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "# @everyone Trailer below - The idea was all from me and civic !\n\n\"Sir, it's here. The Paltrum you wanted.\"\n\nMalvick's assistant carefully placed the strange object onto the table.\n\nMalvick stared at it for a moment before looking toward him.\n\n\"Call Security Services. Let them know we have the weapon they need.\"\n\nThe assistant nodded and turned toward the door.\n\n\"May God be with you, good man.\"\n\nLater that night, Malvick sat quietly at home.\n\nHis wife noticed the unusual look on his face.\n\n\"What was that Paltrum thing you gave to them, honey?\"\n\nShe looked at him nervously.\n\n\"Is it dangerous?\"\n\nMalvick slowly turned toward her.\n\nHis expression was completely serious.\n\n\"It's not a thing of this world.\"\n\nHe looked toward the window.\n\n\"It's made by him.\"",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1535844738408652870/content.png?ex=6a866d60&is=6a851be0&hm=888eff28e864ed2d931a98358ce6478525c52e80e5c4e7b42688fbbb6ae5b63e&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 1965860
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535844738890989569",
            "created_at": "2026-08-09T02:58:40.367000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535845550606262302,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "\"Has it arrived yet?\"\n\nThe commander stood in the center of the room, waiting impatiently.\n\n\"The Paltrum from Mervick?\" the soldier replied. \"Yes, sir.\"\n\nThe commander smiled.\n\nBut the soldier wasn't finished.\n\n\"Someone else arrived with it.\"\n\nThe room suddenly became quiet.\n\nThe doors opened.\n\nA woman stepped inside.\n\n\"Hello again.\"\n\nShe smiled.\n\n\"King Julien of SS.\"\n\nThe commander's expression immediately changed.\n\n\"...You.\"",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1535845550312915024/content.png?ex=6a866e21&is=6a851ca1&hm=d7b07fd935e782c47e258c18e85eef1aa43d7b628c4399ee81c37ca9ff633c3d&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 1728147
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535845550606262302",
            "created_at": "2026-08-09T03:01:53.895000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535845840910815242,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "Something was coming.\n\nSomething nobody was prepared for.\n\nThey said this person's Aro had evolved into something never seen before.\n\nAn Aro capable of making things come to life.\n\nBut the things he created weren't normal.\n\nThey weren't creatures.\n\nThey weren't machines.\n\nThey weren't even things that belonged to this world.\n\nThey were something else entirely.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535845840910815242",
            "created_at": "2026-08-09T03:03:03.109000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535846404881391728,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "Liam walked through the ruins, stepping over broken concrete and shattered pieces of buildings.\n\nHe looked around casually.\n\n\"How hard is it to take down a person who just makes art?\"\n\nHe continued walking.\n\n\"Where are you... Drum?\"\n\nNothing answered.\n\nLiam looked around.\n\n\"Was that your name?\"\n\nHe sighed.\n\n\"You're just a young artist. You aren't dangerous.\"\n\nHe approached the entrance of a ruined building.\n\n\"Come out of your hi—\"\n\nLiam disappeared.\n\nThere was no explosion.\n\nNo scream.\n\nNo blood.\n\nNo creature.\n\nNothing.\n\nHe simply ceased to exist.\n\nThe ruins became completely silent.",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1535846404579266650/content.png?ex=6a866eed&is=6a851d6d&hm=4aa90630609148ae49d397241bc07176922ad5b24ed6e971c185c82d5db462d0&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 2491518
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535846404881391728",
            "created_at": "2026-08-09T03:05:17.570000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535846950635704340,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "\"He's dangerous.\"\n\nThe officer stood in front of the others, his voice shaking.\n\n\"We're going to need the Triplets and their recruitments.\"\n\nThe commander looked at him.\n\n\"The Yellow Heroes?\"\n\n\"Yes, sir.\"\n\nThe commander stared at him for a moment.\n\nThen his expression changed.\n\n\"What is it?\"\n\nThe officer lowered his head.\n\n\"Every Yellow Hero has died.\"\n\nSilence filled the room.\n\nThe commander immediately reached for the phone.\n\n\"Get Michele on the phone.\"\n\nHe slammed his hand onto the desk.\n\n\"NOW.\"",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1535846950291898368/content.png?ex=6a866f6f&is=6a851def&hm=e3b50ef5aed752d0e9280796575b5c3b3c4bc4019679d7216aaab3e50d669a32&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 2574584
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535846950635704340",
            "created_at": "2026-08-09T03:07:27.688000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535849934702645248,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "Michele, listen carefully.\n\nThe commander's voice came through the phone.\n\nRecruit from the Special Adoption Agency.\n\nMichele froze.\n\nThe Agency?\n\nBut Mervick—\n\nI DON'T CARE!\n\nMervick slammed his fist against the table.\n\nThey may have dangerous children.\n\nHe looked down at the scattered files covering his desk.\n\nChildren from where he came from.\n\nHis voice became quieter.\n\nBut we need them.\n\nHe slowly turned toward the window.\n\nA figure was standing there.\n\nMervick froze.\n\nThe figure had been there the entire time.\n\nYou’re begging for more young heroes?\n\nThe voice was calm.\n\nAlmost playful.\n\nI'll make them for you.\n\nThe figure stepped closer to the window.\n\nA billion, if you need.\n\nI'll let you in on a little secret.\n\nThe figure smiled.\n\nChildren cannot defeat me.\n\nHe looked directly at Mervick.\n\nAnd I'll show you why.\n\nMervick suddenly grabbed his weapon.\n\nWho the hell are—\n\nHis sentence stopped.\n\nHis body began disappearing.\n\nNot burning.\n\nNot bleeding.\n\nNot exploding.\n\nHe simply began to cease to exist.\n\nHis skin faded away like wet paint being wiped from a canvas.\n\nHis hands disappeared.\n\nThen his arms.\n\nThen his chest.\n\nMervick stared at himself in horror.\n\nMEVRICK!\n\nHis wife screamed and ran toward him.\n\nMY HUSBAND!\n\nThe figure turned toward her.\n\nBe quiet, woman.\n\nHe grabbed her by the throat and lifted her effortlessly from the ground.\n\nShe struggled against his grip.\n\nBut the figure didn't even seem bothered.\n\nHe stared deeply into her eyes.\n\nSlowly, her vision began disappearing.\n\nThe world around her faded into darkness.\n\nHer face became pale.\n\nWhat do you see?\n\nShe could barely speak.\n\n...Darkness.\n\nThe figure smiled.\n\nYes.\n\nHis smile grew wider.\n\nYou see the real me.\n\nHis hand moved.\n\nA blade pierced straight through her chest.\n\nHer body went limp.\n\nThe figure continued smiling.\n\nMy name...\n\nHe looked toward the camera.\n\n...is Vesper.",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1535849934375616512/content.png?ex=6a867237&is=6a8520b7&hm=42934ca9f9eacf072eb747254d93d07052e0ab217e28ef893baa9670e72f5777&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 1796144
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1535849934702645248",
            "created_at": "2026-08-09T03:19:19.145000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535852762405928960,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "post-Credit\n\nIf the multiverse is real... and our world is ending and cannot be saved, will there be a person out there who can help us?\n\nSomeone who has dealt with this before?\n\nIf it comes to that...\n\nI know some people.\n\nWho?\n\n\n**I don't know when the game will start depends on civics timing as Im NOT writing when it does.Only near the end. **",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1535852761659346944/content.png?ex=6a8674d9&is=6a852359&hm=bfc9f1c306611a0d557f8768e92e73fc9448e9128d6179c54655a2129646d286&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 2326277
