            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**you run inside the facility and find kaijen unconscious**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536965883937689610",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:13:42.176000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536966317662535762,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**As you keep watching your surroundings and keep moving, you look above one of the buildings and see a giant man standing there looking down at you and the others**",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535189087282008118/1536966317226201168/content.png?ex=6a868d6d&is=6a853bed&hm=1d848e6e90a6a53263081b19d56b16a822c2345fb3277d46de95c83799c32195&",
                "content_type": "image/png",
                "size": 2372146
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536966317662535762",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:15:25.584000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536966976889557082,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "oh nah thats his tail",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536966976889557082",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:18:02.756000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536967585621610546,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**Vespa jumped from the building above them, landing effortlessly before reaching up and grabbing one of his horns. His massive body began to shrink until he stood at an ordinary height. He looked across the Yellow Heroes, his eight eyes studying each of them before he smiled faintly. \"The Yellow Heroes? Is that what they call you? Children... taken from Earth and brought here to save a world that fears people like us? A world that tests those with Aro, rejects them, uses them, and then calls you heroes?\" He slowly pointed at each of them. \"Tell me... if this world has given you nothing but hatred, why fight for it? Why bleed for people who would have never bled for you?\" \"I let one of my eyes cry for you, while another watches you slowly die. You are not heroes you're betrayers of your own kind.\"**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536967585621610546",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:20:27.889000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536968395679998064,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**I look at each and every one of you and see nothing but saddened kids, he begins walking to each person touching them and showing them memories they could have if they don't go with ss, mevricks team begin shooting him but no bullet is going near him they all drop on the floor before even reaching him, he walks toward his own sister,\" My beautiful sister\" brother, she says tears falling down from her eyes, he grabs her neck and bursts her head open, \"I killed my own sister for you yellow heroes, will you now not join my conquest?\" **",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536968395679998064",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:23:41.022000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536969127502290955,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**Ravvu was put in an eternal looping death where he kills his own family and himself over and over.**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536969127502290955",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:26:35.502000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536969395660660736,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**Does no one heed my words? yellow hereos, join me or die like the cunts you are.**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536969395660660736",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:27:39.436000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536970014488264704,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**I ask you kaij- he stopped, you aren't a yellow hero or at least not yet, I see you - Arlo? xythereon, many names you've had, and many powers, you aren't from here, and nor are this other people with you, no wonder you listened so quickly! he said taking one of his horns and writing \"original hereos to have their minds and this outcasts to see what happens when one controls anothers outcome.\"**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536970014488264704",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:30:06.976000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536970554647781447,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**With the pen in writing - the yellow hereos became their original selves, but all hope was lost for them, as soon as they tried to attack him, they all felt what it meant to be a lost soul for he put them in a loop where they live a life where no one is with them, and as for the player's, Vespa took each of their ghostless brains out to study..**\n\n**DEMO OVER**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536970554647781447",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:32:15.760000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536972270440947738,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**De-Demo?**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536972270440947738",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:39:04.837000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536972390750494810,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**SCENE: Vespas lab:  This brains are not helping me at all, for beings that are from another multiverse, I'd tihnk they'd be powerful, but to what reason have they arrived here? vespa takes one of his horns this time a pencil, and begins drawing each player's originally character and bringin them there at that moment in his lab with chains around them to lock them in place, he then says,\" the celestial lyonia? were you called adelram, and you a being with cells that adjust to any surroundings almost impossible to touch, all this is fascinating and with no aro at all, explain to me how one can harvest such an ability without using evolution or aro as their main source**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536972390750494810",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:39:33.521000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536972796654125200,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**This celestial form, tell me about it - how can one being use it without having to use an aro ?**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536972796654125200",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:41:10.296000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536973389468803122,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**Vespa stared at him, all eight eyes fixed upon his opponent. “A one on one? Without my pens, and with nothing but these eight eyes, I could show you one trillion versions of this duel. No armies No allies No one coming to save either of us. Just you and me Nine hundred billion of those versions would be me as I was when I was young and you would be the strongest version of yourself that could ever exist. Yet in not one of them do you win**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536973389468803122",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:43:31.634000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536973541184897104,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**Vespa begins drawing the celestial form you once hide creating 8 of them, he says - which of this forms would look great on me you think? **",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536973541184897104",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:44:07.806000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1536976687135203399,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**After interrogating the players, Vespa undrew them completely, erasing them from every universe. He then turned his attention to the TWNVERSE, preparing to harvest the Oasis and Quill and fuse them with his Aro to become The Complete. When the real game begins, survive SS's tests, become a Yellow Hero, grow stronger, and stop Vespa before he achieves his ultimate goal.**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1536976687135203399",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T05:56:37.859000+00:00"
          },
