            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Welcome the new generation of yellow hero's, we've long awaited your return, this is facility you are being held in is none other than the famous security service, where we train kids like you to become powerful beings unfortunately our last yellow hero's all perished to that monster vespa but I am sure and believe that you all have what it takes to not only defeat him but to become stronger than him but before we begin with the testing I would like one of you to get on the bed please**",
