            "content": "**Dr octar began doing his tests on arlo but something went wrong as his body was way bigger than the systems maximum weightline, emergency lights began showing and the bed began shocking arlo, Dr octar and his people tried to stop the test so it won't break the system due to the size they were unable to get him off and the system failed**",
