          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538160067633881119,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "His left eye is covered by a black leather eyepatch, while his visible right eye is a vivid emerald green. His covered left eye is naturally an unusual deep indigo-violet, with a faint luminous ring around the iris that becomes more noticeable in darkness or when he is experiencing strong emotions. The effect is subtle enough that it doesn't immediately appear magical. A thin, shallow scar runs beneath the eyepatch and extends slightly toward his eyebrow. The injury was never severe enough to impair his vision, and he can still see normally from both eyes; he simply continues wearing the eyepatch out of habit and personal style.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1538160067633881119",
