            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Here is my cage, I've captured three strong creatures to give the yellow hero's, I have more but because you are the only three here so far, I'll have to give it to you early, please pick one and don't fight over it**",
            "attachments": [
