            "content": "**As the feast was going on and the companions were eating their desired food, Raja began explaining how harsh one's life could be if not for security services,\" I want you three to visit Mankrian, which is west side of here, where life is in such hard conditions, a place where no children should even be born with, and when you are there I want you to remember, that place is where people like Vespa come from, It isn't anyone's fault that he turned out like this, it's merely the location he was born in**",
