          {
            "message_id": 1539578942749671484,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1311460994660306996,
            "author_name": "Draven",
            "content": "Stup",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539578942749671484",
            "created_at": "2026-08-19T10:17:03.945000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535433388989620285,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1311460994660306996,
            "author_name": "Draven",
            "content": "# @everyone  ARO\n\nAro is the life essence that flows through every living being. Once your Aro awakens, you're randomly assigned 1 of 9 unique Classes. You can't choose your Class or inherit it it's the path your Aro decides for you.\n\nAnd yes. Aro is a concious life essence it decides everything FOR you but you guide it to.\n\nEach Class grants its own unique abilities, from 🌊 Tyrerors, who command liquids, to 🔥 Infernias, who wield flames, 🌌 Gravitos, who bend gravity, and many more. Every Class has the potential to become just as powerful through training and mastery.\n\nAs your Aro grows, so does your Class, unlocking stronger abilities and new techniques. But for the few who reach a Critical Evolution Point, a legendary 💛 Yellow Evolution Stone may completely rewrite their Aro, creating a Class that has never existed before. These Evolutions are shaped by the user's personality, experiences, and true nature, making every one completely unique.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1535433388989620285",
            "created_at": "2026-08-07T23:44:06.908000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535433538608955402,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1311460994660306996,
            "author_name": "Draven",
            "content": "3 key features within aro",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1535433538608955402",
            "created_at": "2026-08-07T23:44:42.580000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535433639481835531,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1311460994660306996,
            "author_name": "Draven",
            "content": "Feature 1: Aro Growth\n\n• Every choice you make affects your Aro, causing it to either grow stronger or weaker over time\n\n• Two players with the same Class can awaken with completely different levels of Aro depending on the choices they've made\n\n• Your Aro reflects the person you've become, not just the Class you have\n\nFeature 2: Aro Colours\n\n• Before awakening, you can use !glow to check the current state of your Aro\n\n• Red means your Aro is weakening\n\n• Green means your Aro is growing stronger\n\n• Blue means your Aro is close to awakening\n\n• Yellow means your Aro is currently evolving\n\n• Once your Aro awakens, the Blue glow can never appear again\n\nFeature 3: Connecting with Aro\n\n• Before awakening, you can communicate with your Aro and build a connection with it\n\n• The stronger and more genuine your connection, the stronger your future Class will become\n\n• Aro always knows your true intentions, so trying to connect with it only for power will weaken your Aro instead",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1535433639481835531",
            "created_at": "2026-08-07T23:45:06.630000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1535434101622964234,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1311460994660306996,
            "author_name": "Draven",
            "content": "another big thing your aro takes the form which you want it. can not be nsfw",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1535434101622964234",
            "created_at": "2026-08-07T23:46:56.813000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538119199715500032,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1463100226318368874,
            "author_name": "Ricoo",
            "content": "**Aro Titan - the first being to ever have aro and the one to essentially give aro to everyone else, think of this beast as the original aro, her name is Mother Prana, The strongest being in Aethelgard (Nova-7) the planet in which the storyline takes place and the verse is RoR, this beast is untamable unless by a force which somehow takes full control of aro removing its limitation, the chances of that happening is almost impossible but also possible**\n\n**Also, Mother prana is the original titan there are 5 more titans which each live in a country and safeguard, the titans only awake if they feel like their world is doomed, if all 6 titans come together in the middle they'll create a powerful blast called the eternal, this blast get's sent into the sky with all 6 powering it creating a seventh Titan, and that seventh titan then triggers a natural cosmic reset similar to a Big Bang, destroying the old universe and naturally resetting the cycle**\n\n**The titan's on their own aren't gods or beings of high level but natures way of saving the planet**",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
