            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1538119199715500032",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T09:36:34.085000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538124407942156418,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Explaining how the game will begin - who the main villian is, the main quest of the game, power levels, awakening aro + evolving it,**\n\n\n**Main Villian :  Vespa - A man who came from nothing become something but is being stopped by the limitations aro has, and from his knowledge, the multiverse is his only answer of obtaining the source to being able to freely use aro without any limitations at all becoming \"The Final\", but in order to gain that form, he needs to study about the multiverse, Vespa is powerful but his power truly stems from his knowledge, he figured out before anyone else that yellow stones help boost your awakening giving you a complete new class and forms, before he was this giant killer, he was an ordinary kid with no family, stolen and put in Security services to become one of the yellow hereos, but they only treated him as less, gaining no power form the training and no skill, he instead relied on his ability to think and began making using what he had gathered before he was kidnapped, a yellow stone, eventually awakening, to him, his trying to stop something no one really knows what but the ss and councils are trying to stop him from obtaining his most powerful form**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1538124407942156418",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T09:57:15.823000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538124828731506728,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Main Quest : Recruited by the SS you're main mission is to stop Vespa from gaining his Final form + A secret mission you can only obtain if storyline goes in order**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1538124828731506728",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T09:58:56.147000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538125209058672684,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**I think we already explained power levels it's called aro colours, just scroll up Wont explain again ;-;**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1538125209058672684",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T10:00:26.824000+00:00"
          },
