            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Awakening aro + evolving can happen any time in the storyline early or late as hell, lowk depends on what you make your character do **",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1538125359810347030",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T10:01:02.766000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1538134191039057981,
