            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "# @everyone Last PING! \n\n\nThe Classes \n\nAure - The power to control the essence of light itself\nTyreror - The power to control any time of liquid (even blood)\nInfernia - The power to control flames (with white flames being the hardest to obtain and control )\nGravitos - the power to control gravity itself\nAstria - The power to manipulate space\nMystia - the power to control ones mind\nTempest - The power to control lightning",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087760154667/1538134191039057981",
            "created_at": "2026-08-15T10:36:08.295000+00:00"
