          {
            "message_id": 1539930206481944636,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Raja enter's into the head of security services, he looks at the camera,\" Is this from team 775FR? he asks, the guards afraid reply with a nod. Raja nod's his face in shock and walks into the assembly room where almost 300 people were waiting for him**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539930206481944636",
            "created_at": "2026-08-20T09:32:51.745000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1539930424875294812,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "its team kaizens",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539930424875294812",
            "created_at": "2026-08-20T09:33:43.814000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1539931204726431776,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Raja,\" My fellow student's, guards and friends yesterday night we witnessed one of the worst incidents ever recorded near vesperia, A Vinran evolved from a radiation blast it got hit with and has now turned into A Vekrin, one of the most dangerous creatures on this planet, we sent some young yellow hero's to contain it before the 8 world wonderers arrived but by the time they did every kid we sent was vaporized all because a team decided it was good to use radiation against a creature made from chemicals !**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539931204726431776",
            "created_at": "2026-08-20T09:36:49.745000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1539931858756960276,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**One of the 8th wonderers, 2nd strongest, Kayla told us there was so much blood and a missing hand left in the scene**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539931858756960276",
            "created_at": "2026-08-20T09:39:25.678000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1539932542608875630,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Raja nods his head and some guards bring an entire arm cut from the end in a glass box, he puts it for display for everyone to look at, this was the end that we found in the scene he then said, could the person whose hand this is please stand up**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539932542608875630",
            "created_at": "2026-08-20T09:42:08.721000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1539933125499551824,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Every single person stares at you**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1539933125499551824",
            "created_at": "2026-08-20T09:44:27.693000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1539933172396068895,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
