            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Raja steps forward to the micrpohone, I want to introduce to the yellow hereos what we call Houses, Houses are in its essence teams made up of yellow hero's fighting for their own justice, each house is in a different country which they will protect and propser, you can NOT change your house once your name is called please grab your necklace and go to your house**",
