          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540313035921694730,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "I swear no one listens to the lore",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540313035921694730",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T10:54:05.396000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540313228775792711,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**On the other side of the world in the desert, a being appeared from another universe**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540313228775792711",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T10:54:51.376000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540313360753627216,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Grabbing the sand from the floor, sniffing it, moving his head left and right, his eyes opening,\"At last, a new world, he said**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540313360753627216",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T10:55:22.842000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540313862803562506,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**His tail whipping the sand literally absorbing the sand as it hit, his skin literally turning into sand bit by bit**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540313862803562506",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T10:57:22.540000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540314526765944903,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**his third eye opening allowing him to see the world in a holographic like state where it tells him every information he needs**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540314526765944903",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T11:00:00.841000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540314865413918721,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**In the distances away from him was Mevrick**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540314865413918721",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T11:01:21.581000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540315069965926451,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**you aren't supposed to be here, this isn't your world! Mevrick pleaded**\n\n**But the stranger didn't care he simply said,\" Bring vespa out of you human.**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540315069965926451",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T11:02:10.350000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540315411663429794,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**I'm warning you, if he comes out the world will not survive**\n**Do you take me for a weak person human? he asked, but mevrick was having any of it, he seemed to be stressing holing his heart trying to stop himself from shifting**",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540315411663429794",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T11:03:31.817000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540315759765495849,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Mevrick screamed falling back on the sand, his hands shivering, I don't want to face you demon, please leave me alone! **",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535189087282008118/1540315759765495849",
            "created_at": "2026-08-21T11:04:54.811000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540316162120880168,
            "channel_id": 1535189087282008118,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Jinka chuckled, the last world I was in I almost got what I needed, I failed but this time, I'll make sure I succeed **",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "content.png",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535189087282008118/1540316161714036766/content.png?ex=6a8982b6&is=6a883136&hm=d7023eb470bd59a938b47cc8b64b440f56c632d04463307de1d280d0fe3ae94c&",
