            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Jinka ran towards mevrick and as he did his entire body became sand, he grabbed mevrick from under completely submerging him under the sand**",
