            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**you opened the door standing in front of it was Dr maverick for a moment you saw his right eye turn bright red, his normal human mouth turn completely grey, four large horns appearing on his forehead, he was holding his arm in place which was literally falling off, in immense pain he begged for a place to stay he has nowhere to go, he then showed you a picture of his family, his dead wife and his two kids one of them was his oldest son, his name is Ravvu, he said in a quite sad life, my entire family was killed by this monster inside me, please I can't live like this I'll help you kill me**",
