          {
            "message_id": 1540989728046850098,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1187513925739237408,
            "author_name": "civic",
            "content": "# **@everyone Trailer Below - backstorys and ideas were written by me and Draven**\n\n\n\n**ZERO**\n\nHe was once known as Subject Zero.\n\nAn experiment created to manipulate Aro—the life essence within all living beings.\n\nWhen his power awakened, all he could create were bubbles.\n\nThe scientists called him a failure.\n\nBut his bubbles defied the laws of physics.\n\nThey could pass through walls...\n\nBarriers...\n\nAnd even living beings.\n\nDuring his time in the facility, Zero found an ordinary wooden staff.\n\nIt became his weapon.\n\nWith it, he learned to fill his bubbles with dangerous compounds and elements.\n\nBut the scientists eventually realised...\n\nZero was becoming too dangerous to control.\n\nThey tried to destroy him.\n\nInstead, Zero escaped.\n\nDeep within the facility, he discovered something far more powerful.\n\nThe Yellowstone.\n\nA mysterious crystal containing an enormous concentration of Aro.\n\nDesperate to never be powerless again...\n\nZero consumed it.\n\nThe Yellowstone transformed him.\n\nHis bubbles became destructive.\n\nHis staff became something more than wood.\n\nAnd he gained the ability to steal Aro itself.\n\nThe more he absorbed...\n\nThe faster and stronger he became.\n\nWhat began as a desire for freedom...\n\nBecame an obsession with absolute power.\n\n\"They called me Zero because they thought I was nothing.\"\n\n\"So I decided to take everything...\"\n\n\"Until Zero was all that remained.\"",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1540989728046850098",
            "created_at": "2026-08-23T07:43:01.371000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540989834099691591,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1187513925739237408,
            "author_name": "civic",
            "content": "**KRIM**\n\nBut Zero was not the only one.\n\nHe was once known as Subject K.\n\nAn experiment created in the same facility.\n\nHis power came from shadows...\n\nAnd probability.\n\nHe could create hallucinations.\n\nManipulate the outcome of actions.\n\nAnd shrink anyone whose actions or thoughts could threaten him.\n\nThe scientists saw his potential.\n\nBut they never saw him as a person.\n\nThey abused him.\n\nExperimented on him.\n\nAnd used his powers for their own profit.\n\nThen he met Zero.\n\nTwo experiments.\n\nTwo people who understood each other's suffering.\n\nTogether, they escaped.\n\nBut they were separated soon after.\n\nYears passed.\n\nKrim searched for Zero.\n\nUntil he discovered his own Yellowstone.\n\nCornered and desperate...\n\nHe consumed it.\n\nThe Yellowstone awakened something far greater within him.\n\nHis hallucinations grew stronger.\n\nHis control over probability grew greater.\n\nAnd something destructive awakened within his power.\n\nBut Krim never forgot Zero.\n\nHe discovered the truth.\n\nTheir Yellowstones were connected.\n\nTheir powers were meant to work together.\n\nThey were separated by fate...\n\nBut neither stopped searching.\n\n\"They taught me that people only care about what you can give them.\"\n\n\"Zero was the first person who cared about who I was.\"\n\nTo this day, Zero and Krim continue to search for one another...\n\nUnaware of what their reunion will ultimately create.",
            "attachments": [],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1540989834099691591",
            "created_at": "2026-08-23T07:43:26.656000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540990004749148260,
            "channel_id": 1535199194967441458,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1187513925739237408,
            "author_name": "civic",
            "content": "",
            "attachments": [
              {
                "filename": "zerokrim.webp",
                "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535199194967441458/1540990004438900736/zerokrim.webp?ex=6a8bf647&is=6a8aa4c7&hm=97aed6f74757c670eaef733bbea8ddf748850a793d9b5b95643803e5d727fead&",
                "content_type": "image/webp",
                "size": 477870
              }
            ],
            "jump_url": "https://discord.com/channels/1535189086258855946/1535199194967441458/1540990004749148260",
            "created_at": "2026-08-23T07:44:07.342000+00:00"
          },
          {
            "message_id": 1540945281678581810,
            "channel_id": 1535189087760154667,
            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "# @everyone Game is expected to end this Saturday\n\n**Show casing your next villian (it'll be two) : Villian 1 - The creature with gold horn, his name is Zero no information is known about him yet other than his name**\n\n**2nd Villian : His name is Krim, also no information about him, when the game ends on friday or saturday it should show Some information on how you get there**",
