            "guild_id": 1535189086258855946,
            "author_id": 1538115083513761813,
            "author_name": "Rivic",
            "content": "**Zone: A being with the ability to control time itself, his enemies who have survived have said that last thing they see is that clock on his neck moving slowly before their eyes shut, Zone is the strongest Time user ever created in terms of DnD (only when it comes to having time)**",
